[{"title":"四禽词奉答顾孟仁 其三 野鹤","author":"林弼","text":"野鹤野鹤舞骨削，缟衣不受缁尘着。\n朝刷沧溟桃浪深，夜警空山松雪落。\n忘机每与鸥鹭亲，高标岂是鸡鹜群。\n千年独归人已换，九皋一声天亦闻。\n云林暂尔寄栖止，风翮终当翔万里。\n可怜青鸟俗未除，白日传音下瑶水。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33446,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四禽词奉答顾孟仁 其四 鸿雁","author":"林弼","text":"嗷嗷鸿雁肃肃飞，秋风南征春北归。\n分行已深兄弟念，哀鸣复重民生悲。\n吴江水深楚云断，美人银筝动清怨。\n忍将尺素寄远游，万里遥天寸心乱。\n西风冷入芦花秋，稻粱晚岁难为谋。\n潇湘秖今多旅客，有声莫度岳阳楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33447,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"徐梅所知司席上以榴花命题分得万字","author":"林弼","text":"栾巴饮酒空中噀，屏翳疾驱回禄遁。\n火鸟无数西南飞，化作榴花赤光喷。\n南风五月庭院凉，满地云阴覆烟蔓。\n眼明见此珊瑚枝，犹信群芳未荒顿。\n猩红绡巾晓初蹙，血色罗裙春未褪。\n芙蓉开迟不复怨，海棠香减宁无恨。\n谩怜地僻车马稀，空叹春归蜂蝶困。\n人生有花且对酒，一举金觞须百劝。\n移根当得乘槎骞，作诗喜有梅花逊。\n君看上苑芳菲时，红紫东风自千万。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33448,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"齐云亭奇石歌","author":"林弼","text":"何年星芒化山骨，古色苍颜势崷崒。\n就中别有混沌天，万象森罗了毫发。\n府公移置齐云亭，一府来看零阳屏。\n蓬莱清浅隔弱水，君山晻霭浮洞庭。\n我疑太阴照天地，山河倒影摇丹桂。\n又疑明河泻九天，斗牛腾光通剑气。\n公馀对此独踌蹰，咫尺万里论江湖。\n幽篁古木在眼底，何用人间俗画图。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33449,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丁酉九日次徐梅所知司座主韵","author":"林弼","text":"四时清景惟秋九，斗酒何妨诗百首。\n苍苍白露满蒹葭，淅淅凉风动榆柳。\n一年佳景惟重九，晋代风流谁踵后。\n野萸垂紫映华簪，篱菊开黄出丰蔀。\n归田未许游宦人，登山喜得论文友。\n季鹰江上足莼羹，陶令山中有松酒。\n人生自古贵适意，尘世于今几开口。\n劝君西风一百觞，祝君南山千万寿。\n丈夫气岸在云霄，为我胸怀洗堆阜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33450,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉次柏轩先生韵为梅所徵君寿","author":"林弼","text":"忆我昔日游吴东，陈迹曾访孤山翁。\n梅花千树湖水曲，茅堂半亩梅花中。\n别来岁月几流易，一见梅花兴无极。\n东山东畔西湖西，千载清风只如一。\n不须此地感今昨，且向南枝观复剥。\n野桥石出水未生，江路云凝雪初阁。\n主人自是神仙者，藜杖葛巾花树下。\n寒英疏映霜菊明，老干斜依风竹亚。\n天生嘉植真瑰奇，古来幽士多爱之。\n今人已追古人躅，后人行复今人追。\n梅花于人元耐久，百年对花当对酒。\n愿倾北斗为君觞，更指东山祝君寿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33451,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和南圃老人龙岩书事","author":"林弼","text":"苍岩百叠树交绿，石栈九折车失轴。\n山腰忽断峡山来，小溪新水流寒玉。\n溪上茅茨两三屋，野人足音喜空谷。\n开门迎客敬三肃，壶有香醪盘有菽。\n自云今年雨雪足，山棱夏收稻秋熟。\n稻可酒兮棱可粥，生来城府无轨躅。\n德公耕?鹿门麓，子真桑麻谷口曲。\n但令食饱与衣燠，不慕轻裘嗜醲郁。\n我闻此语泪盈掬，泽国干戈嗟满目。\n商山采芝忘宠辱，武陵种桃谢尘俗。\n溪居便向野人卜，马蹄安用浮世逐。\n采山钓水耕且读，不管人间忙祸福。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33452,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"双柏轩歌为黄君复院长赋","author":"林弼","text":"黄君开轩紫山曲，手植双柏如云绿。\n南风吹雨生夏寒，两盖清阴覆书屋。\n摩挲老眼四十年，龙枝凤叶俱苍然。\n春阳庭阶已竞秀，岁寒冰雪应同坚。\n君家况有徐卿子，风骨崭崭双柏侣。\n耸壑昂霄看异时，长材大用从兹始。\n我来径造轩之中，开樽爱此阴重重。\n昔闻彭泽醉五柳，今见蓝田哦二松。\n皇天不惜栽培力，移根好向乌台植。\n西斋酒醒月在天，为君起舞歌双柏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33453,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵杨秉中县尹春日病中述怀 其一","author":"林弼","text":"谩道春来好，愁多日更长。\n看蜗知胜负，听燕识兴亡。\n风雨五更梦，云山千里望。\n浊醪吾尔爱，能涤九回肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33454,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵杨秉中县尹春日病中述怀 其二","author":"林弼","text":"竹牖春风外，柴门暮雨馀。\n尊无陶令酒，架有邺侯书。\n旧业俱荒落，閒愁莫扫除。\n白头依狗监，惭愧马相如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33455,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵杨秉中县尹春日病中述怀 其三","author":"林弼","text":"海宇开新造，山林起久跧。\n夔龙时接武，巢许分投閒。\n燕乳草生巷，莺啼花满山。\n临风时一笑，鬓为赋诗斑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33456,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵杨秉中县尹春日病中述怀 其四","author":"林弼","text":"彭泽先归去，湘江后卜居。\n纫兰谁复佩，种秫自能锄。\n老丑慵看镜，穷愁独著书。\n且须相觅醉，烧笋鲙鲈鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33457,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵杨秉中县尹春日病中述怀 其五","author":"林弼","text":"山云白苍莽，江树绿参差。\n弟妹几时见，家园十载离。\n沈腰常减带，潘鬓易成丝。\n苦听竹枝曲，教人坐石迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33458,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵杨秉中县尹春日病中述怀 其六","author":"林弼","text":"窗竹晴逾静，庭花煖自开。\n客閒时共对，邻熟许移栽。\n司马元多病，襄阳岂不才。\n石田与茅屋，归去未荒苔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33459,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵杨秉中县尹春日病中述怀 其七","author":"林弼","text":"白头逢丧乱，愁绝浣花翁。\n不道兵尘苦，犹存诗句工。\n深春忧肺病，远道愧囊空。\n待得茅堂就，归来万事慵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33460,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵杨秉中县尹春日病中述怀 其八","author":"林弼","text":"南国江山旧，东风红紫新。\n醉来忘避地，老近怕逢春。\n曾是菊松主，还如草莽臣。\n无穷怀古意，清泪满衣巾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33461,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵杨秉中县尹春日病中述怀 其九","author":"林弼","text":"自笑尘中逐，能存乱后身。\n春如人渐老，时与物俱新。\n每有乘槎意，长怀击壤民。\n床头书剑在，吾道未全贫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33462,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵杨秉中县尹春日病中述怀 其十","author":"林弼","text":"我本耕耘者，春畴忆种秧。\n岸低新水上，泥润细苔香。\n呼酒柳边店，留诗竹外房。\n年来清乐少，枯坐学颜忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33463,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题王佐山人画","author":"林弼","text":"山光杂空翠，云影澹晴晖。\n古渡舟谁系，虚斋人未归。\n石苔秋雨积，野树晚风微。\n便欲抛尘事，垂纶柳外矶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33464,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题王廷圭画","author":"林弼","text":"秋色晴山迥，烟光野水连。\n空林辋川外，古树草堂前。\n天地留诗卷，江湖老钓船。\n美人隔云汉，对此思悠然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33465,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十八滩 其一","author":"林弼","text":"溪竹亦多景，诗句每无难。\n云净山争出，湍惊石自安。\n旅怀拚酒盏，生事愧渔竿。\n犹觉壮心在，孤舟十八滩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33466,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十八滩 其二","author":"林弼","text":"万壑荆闽接，双溪章贡来。\n风声随雨散，水势与山回。\n石藓痕痕合，岩花点点开。\n客心浑似砥，滩怒谩如雷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33467,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十八滩 其三","author":"林弼","text":"十八滩头路，三千里外身。\n如何满船月，常照异乡人。\n神剑占新气，仙槎问旧津。\n小臣重王事，陟险敢辞频。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33468,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"英德舟中","author":"林弼","text":"舟行浈峡里，景似左江中。\n峰峭千层石，溪回一队风。\n瘴云寒渐白，野烧晚犹红。\n已喜诗囊富，何愁客路穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33469,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江西送郭中敏还广东","author":"林弼","text":"使节江关外，归舟风雪前。\n同来怜远道，别去惜离筵。\n草绿曾游地，苔荒旧种田。\n越台回首日，春满五云天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33470,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"除夕","author":"林弼","text":"今夕复除夕，难为守岁谋。\n江山非故国，风雪尚孤舟。\n榾柮红生面，梅花白上头。\n穷年未归去，莫怪杜陵愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33471,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"人日","author":"林弼","text":"皇天调光霁，野宇遍清明。\n风岸初舒柳，杨林欲啭莺。\n升平应有象，边报永无惊。\n野老忧心释，诗成酒满倾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33472,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"彭泽重登潮音阁追和陶参政韵","author":"林弼","text":"神姑近可即，天女邈难攀。\n飞阁虚空里，疏钟杳霭间。\n潮迎归越海，云渡隔淮山。\n拟学禅栖乐，何时身乞还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33473,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"平南县","author":"林弼","text":"舟泊平南县，江干得暂閒。\n水添今日雨，云失旧时山。\n禹甸连三楚，秦封入百蛮。\n清时无畏道，容易越河关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33474,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题林德仁永思堂卷","author":"林弼","text":"吾宗昔旌孝，双阙俨犹存。\n甘露降林木，白乌栖墓门。\n永言思阿父，今复见诸孙。\n幸得慈帷下，均酬罔极恩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33475,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"罗时用之浦江县令","author":"林弼","text":"小邑边西北，兵馀贵抚摩。\n但令息愁叹，渐可化弦歌。\n陇树春犹在，秦云夏更多。\n悬知官事简，日对二松哦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33476,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题小林居图","author":"林弼","text":"幽居学林隐，宴坐息尘营。\n萝月开窗色，松风欹枕声。\n山花多结子，野草不知名。\n寄谢朝簪客，能同丘壑情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33477,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹居","author":"林弼","text":"昔与宋中使，时来竹外居。\n秋声满窗户，晴影落阶除。\n煮笋常兼肉，裁竿或得鱼。\n爱君幽遁处，直欲世情疏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33478,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅屋","author":"林弼","text":"我屋梅花下，君家梅树傍。\n小池横瘦影，幽户送寒香。\n岁晚竹松节，春寒桃李场。\n知君有所择，归隐得相将。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33479,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望云图","author":"林弼","text":"子役劳亲念，亲遥渴子思。\n望云千里目，陟岵一篇诗。\n碧嶂清江路，祁寒暑雨时。\n看图思努力，他日显扬期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33480,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题孙积中哀劬赋后","author":"林弼","text":"我甫居祥日，君初失恃年。\n长哀同念母，不吊独号天。\n山北云迷舍，溪南月浸船。\n慈颜渺何许，悲涕共潸然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33481,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题方广图","author":"林弼","text":"未识天台路，欣披方广图。\n山灵时听法，野衲日跏趺。\n贝叶松风乱，蒲团石榻孤。\n烟霞有馀乐，还念世尘无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33482,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芝峰僧舍次谢君定韵","author":"林弼","text":"偶借僧房宿，都忘驿骑尘。\n松声半窗雨，草色一庭春。\n倾倒逢今日，栖迟愧此身。\n清朝需董贾，莫作采芝人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33483,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和胡梅所除夕述怀之作","author":"林弼","text":"今夕又除夕，更阑未惬眠。\n江湖犹故我，廊庙正需贤。\n暖散嵩华雪，寒销榾柮烟。\n屠苏明日饮，鹤发喜添年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33484,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题雪斋夜读图赠别吕宗周","author":"林弼","text":"空山半弓室，长夜一编书。\n严风吹北牖，飞雪被前除。\n幽灯素光射，清诵寒声俱。\n游心百世上，努力十年馀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33485,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"至正戊戌春季道莆过方遂初县丞翌日至兴化邑访邑长实达道醉中偶作","author":"林弼","text":"夜宿县丞家，朝过邑长衙。\n故人频劝酒，醉客急呼茶。\n云薄见春树，山深留晚花。\n董园犹在望，新雨足桑麻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33486,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答胡梅所菊节有怀 其一","author":"林弼","text":"秋怀耿耿雁能知，节物匆匆菊较迟。\n袖里空存三礼赋，尊前莫咏四愁诗。\n及时聊复成欢笑，感事多应入梦思。\n为问空湖山下叟，把萸此日共伊谁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33487,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答胡梅所菊节有怀 其二","author":"林弼","text":"菊花要结岁寒知，为爱梅花开故迟。\n彭泽归来空嗜酒，杜陵老去强题诗。\n鸡鸣风雨五更梦，雁落江湖万里思。\n三十潘郎苍鬓改，故人相见问伊谁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33488,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"问胡梅雪病并想山居之乐 其一","author":"林弼","text":"閒居赋就鹤书徵，结屋苍岑第几层。\n松酒山中何日熟，竹楼雨后共谁登。\n忘形定有渔樵侣，淡况应如云水僧。\n屋角梅花无恙否，客来想已送迎能。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33489,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"问胡梅雪病并想山居之乐 其二","author":"林弼","text":"似与林泉有夙期，兴来云月总心知。\n菊花黄后客携酒，蕉叶绿时僧寄诗。\n醉卧不妨风满袖，苦吟未觉雪侵髭。\n石田茅屋如相借，来傍寒梅采玉芝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33490,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"予友李君弥卜居东郭翛然自乐钱君孟道为作图题曰东郭独隐索余赋诗便为书此","author":"林弼","text":"东郭先生爱幽独，茅堂门对碧山春。\n溪旁展席寻鸥伴，松外开窗与鹤邻。\n浅水稻田环绿绕，轻风花馆落红新。\n劳生扰扰知何用，汀树川云入梦频。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33491,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠冲和道人","author":"林弼","text":"三神海上九仙山，分得松房第几间。\n龙剑驱云行雨去，鹤箫吹月御风还。\n偶因耽酒春过市，应为传书晚度关。\n紫府丹台名可注，壶中从子及身閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33492,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三衢程君璋氏访友临漳将归赋此以赠","author":"林弼","text":"三秀峰前采玉芝，高怀遥与白云期。\n江山满目荆州赋，风雨连床杜曲诗。\n万里沧波鸥浩荡，一庭芳草燕差池。\n归来城郭人民换，任烂长柯且看棋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33493,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题张栎里画","author":"林弼","text":"屋前春水绿如醅，屋后春山翠作堆。\n有客抱琴门外立，何人骑马树中来。\n西斋酒尽犹留月，东郭诗成欲放梅。\n三绝广文谁赏识，为君海上望蓬莱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33494,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送伯千之北上","author":"林弼","text":"元戎边画属谁筹，公子乌台旧俊游。\n阮掾久闻三语誉，寇君重借一年留。\n马兰花发迎官道，驼柳条青落御沟。\n尊酒怀人何夜月，五云深处最高楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33495,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送友归永嘉","author":"林弼","text":"平远楼前远望匀，美人遥忆雁山春。\n女桑绿遍蚕将熟，稚麦青齐雉正驯。\n斋阁堆床留魏笏，宾筵漉酒有陶巾。\n西风无限南来翼，好寄新诗莫厌频。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33496,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题南楼","author":"林弼","text":"楼对员山亦壮哉，时凭高处望蓬莱。\n沧江云起九龙舞，华表月明孤鹤来。\n林下茅茨新聚落，水边杨柳小楼台。\n太平不用筹边策，独倚层栏赋雪梅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33497,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偕洪元质游南岩","author":"林弼","text":"紫云邀旆出城南，风物依依真诰岩。\n山石滑人行䠥?，野禽怪客语咕喃。\n秋江远水生葭苇，落日凉风舞桧杉。\n晚对屏前吟未稳，不知空翠湿青衫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33498,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别章仲明用前韵","author":"林弼","text":"此日清游云洞南，明朝远别鹤山岩。\n汀洲水落雁初下，海国秋深燕尚喃。\n驿路风烟连细柳，酒家篱落隔青杉。\n薇垣好展神仙步，莫遣缁尘上客衫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33499,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题漳浦白鹤岭","author":"林弼","text":"栖碧亭空锁翠慰，诗成人世已俱非。\n墨池水暖鹅谁换，华表云间鹤自归。\n楼倚仲宣休作赋，碑思叔子故沾衣。\n古来陈迹知多少，立马西风又落晖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33500,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过盘陀岭","author":"林弼","text":"盘陀岭上几盘陀，茅竹萧萧雨乍过。\n水暖游鱼奔绝涧，草香驯鹿食阳坡。\n怪山当面疑迷路，啼鸟迎人却和歌。\n总为世途多险恶，太行蜀道复如何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33501,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芝峰月夕次韵性元上人足成茶溪公口占之作","author":"林弼","text":"风满空林月满山，无诗堪笑老方干。\n洞云晚散龙眠稳，松露秋高鹤梦寒。\n贺老鉴湖先赐敕，陶公彭泽早辞官。\n他年分我半间屋，待向芝峰绝顶安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33502,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次徐梅所座主访龙江书院有感之作","author":"林弼","text":"访古归来山月孤，紫芝峰影落平湖。\n千秋统绪存方策，万国提封入版图。\n辽海鹤归空露柱，沧州月落满霜芜。\n何时突兀千间厦，风雨如山大庇儒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33503,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再用韵二首 其一","author":"林弼","text":"试问龙江读书地，何如鹿洞与鹅湖。\n梵宫已作新轮奂，郡志空存旧谱图。\n碧玉峰前移老桧，还珠门外剪寒芜。\n记文自可徵千载，太史虞公国钜儒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33504,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再用韵二首 其二","author":"林弼","text":"纸帐更长月影孤，梅花清梦绕西湖。\n左思才擅三都赋，诸葛名成八阵图。\n汉殿丹青俱寂寞，吴宫花草易荒芜。\n白头杜老谋生拙，却道儒冠解误儒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33505,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丁酉元旦 其一","author":"林弼","text":"海气苍茫曙色低，扶桑枝上听天鸡。\n光摇旗旐龙蛇动，班簇衣冠鹓鹭齐。\n重译来庭通桂海，中兴有颂勒浯溪。\n老翁喜见丰年兆，自典春衣酒满携。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33506,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丁酉元旦 其二","author":"林弼","text":"斗杓入夜指东寅，雨脚凌晨洒瘴尘。\n北阙天高先见日，南州地煖早知春。\n独怜丹屿思归客，曾是琼林锡宴人。\n江海此身强健在，何妨鱼鸟日相亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":33507,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]